		{
			"id": "node-web",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🌐 Web Console\n`web/index.html`\n\n**Tech:** HTML5, Tailwind CSS, JS (ES6)\n\n**Key Features:**\n- **SSE Receiver:** `handleEvent`\n- **HITL UI:** `confirmExecution` (Security Check Card)\n- **Visualization:** `iframe` for artifacts",
			"x": -780,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-cli",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 💻 CLI Interface\n`main.py`\n\n**Tech:** Python 3.12, `rich`\n\n**Method:**\n- `async main()`: Event Loop\n- Direct `agent.run()` call",
			"x": -780,
			"y": 240,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-api",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🚀 FastAPI Backend\n`server.py`\n**Version:** `0.128.0`\n\n**Endpoints:**\n- `POST /api/run`: Start/Resume Task\n  - Accepts `thread_id` for resumption\n- `POST /api/upload`: File Upload\n- `event_generator()`: SSE Streaming",
			"x": -340,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-agent-class",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🧠 ManusAgent Class\n`agent.py`\n\n**Methods:**\n- `__init__`: Setup `create_agent` with `middleware`\n- `run(task, thread_id)`: Main Loop\n- `close()`: Cleanup",
			"x": 200,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-langgraph",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ⚙️ LangChain / LangGraph Engine\n**Stack:** `langchain`, `langgraph>=1.0.6`\n\n**Components:**\n- **Model:** `ChatOpenAI` (DeepSeek-V3)\n- **Memory:** `MemorySaver` (Persistence)\n- **Middleware:** `HumanInTheLoopMiddleware`\n  - Intercepts `run_code`, `run_shell_command`\n  - Pauses execution -> Requires `Command(resume=...)`",
			"x": 200,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-tools",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🛠️ Tool Definitions\n`sandbox_e2b.py`\n\n**Decorators:** `@tool`\n\n**List:**\n- `run_code`, `run_shell_command`\n- `read_file`, `write_file`\n- `visualize_file`, `get_public_url`",
			"x": 200,
			"y": 540,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "node-e2b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### ☁️ E2B Sandbox\n**Lib:** `e2b-code-interpreter>=0.0.10`\n\n**Environment:**\n- Firecracker MicroVM\n- Linux (Debian)\n- Python 3.12 Runtime\n- Internet Access",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "note-flow-hitl",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**HITL Flow:**\n1. Agent calls Tool -> Middleware Intercepts -> Pauses Graph.\n2. Server yields `Confirmation Request` (HTML).\n3. User clicks 'Approve' -> Frontend calls `/api/run` with `thread_id`.\n4. Server resumes Agent with `Command(resume={\"decisions\": ...})`.\n5. Tool Executes.",
			"x": -340,
			"y": 260,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "3"
		}
